<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja kujemeka ja Apaulo kwa Bhakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Bhakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Bhak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ja kujemeka ja Apaulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bhakolinto</para>
  <para style="is">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha 1 Bhakolinto chikajandikwa na andundame Apaulo mu yaaka hiikabhandikila hamsini na nhano baada ja kubhelekwa Ayesu Kilisito 1:1. Balua jenjeni jikajemeka pakati ja balua hibhele hiikajandikwa na Apaulo kwa chibhoga cha bhandu chichahobhalile Ayesu bha konokwe ku chilambo cha Kolinto. Komboleka akajandika balua jenjeni pabhatendita kutama ku Efeso tangu ja ulendo gubhakajemeka kujaula ku Kolinto pabhapakujaula na kubhuja kubhoka ku Makedonia 16:5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Apaulo akajandika balua jenjeni kujangula yeniyela hikubho hibhakaijoa kubhoka kwa chibhoga cha bhandu bhangi chibhahobhalile Ayesu kwa ngani ja hikubho yangali yammbone hiikatendekwa pakati ja chibhoga cha bhandu chichahobhalile Ayesu, hibhii pamo na mpwilingano na ngoongola. Bhandu bha chilambo cha ku Kolinto bhakamanyikana muno kwa hikubho ya hijingi ya ngoongola hiikajenela, henela ngabha chikubho chigeni kubhokana kubhee bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bha penapo bhatendita kuhibhila chikubho hecho. Chitabu cha 1 Bhakolinto chibhii na chula yakumanyikana muno hiikongolela kwa ngani ja upalio mu chula ja 13.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo atendakujemeka kwa kwachalimianga bhandu bha ku Bhakolinto na kwaachukulu Annoongo ligongo lyabhenji mu chula ja 1:1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">Pabhakajomola penapo atendakutendela lihengo genigala gabhajoine kwa ngani ja mpwilingano nkati ja chibhoga cha bhandu chichahobhalela Ayesu bha ku Kulinto mu chula ja 1:10, 4:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Pagakapeta genago atendakutendela lihengo kwa ngani ya hikubho ya ngoongola na hikubho hiibhatendelana ya kupelekana kuchebule kwa bhena akaachinabhene mu chula ja 5-6.</para>
  <para style="io">Pabhakajomola penapo akakongolela kwa ngani ja ulombela, kubhoa mbeeko kwa hidimu, kujopa penipala pabhatekondekana bhandu, ngwahupa ya chinnoongo hiibhoka kwa Annoongo na hikubho kwa ngani ja kuyoa mu chula ja 7-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo atendakujomolekea kwa kongolela hikubho yengi ya kupangana na yakwe mweene mu chula ja 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Nenga Apaulo, ndekemwa kubhee andundame bha Akilisito Ayesu kwa upalio gwa Annoongo, mii pambani na Asositene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Tutendakunyandikilanga mwangota chibhoga cha bhandu chichahobhalela Akilisito bha konokwe ku Kolinto, mwangota ntenditingwe kubhee bhandu bha Annoongo mu kolondekana na Akilisito Ayesu, nkakemwanga mmangange bhandu bha Annoongo, pamo na bhandu bhoa poapala pabhaajopa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Akilisito jwaabhii Hangwana bhabhenji na Hangwana bhitu twenga kabhele.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Ndendakwaajopa Annoongo Atati bhitu na Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito ampekeange umbone na kuhengwa.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwaachukulu Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Ndendakwaachukulu Annoongo machobha goa ligongo linunji na ligongo atekumpekeanga mwangota umbone gwabhe kwa kupetela Akilisito Ayesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kwa kubhee kwa kulondanika na Akilisito mpatitinge kila chilebhe, mpatitinge umanyo gwoa na ukolo gwa kutangacha Ngani Jammbone. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Genago galangia kubhee ngani kwa ngani ja Akilisito jitutekwatangachia nga ya kweli, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />henela mwangapongokelwanga na ngwahupa jenijela ja mboomo ja Annoongo mmi kulendelanga kuhika kwabhe Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Jonojwe apakuntendanga mmangange na machili mu kwaatumikila mpaka kupela, ili nkotobhonekananga handa nnemwitinge lichobha lyalela lya Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Annoongo bha kuaminika, jonojwe akaankemanga mwangota mmangange pamo na Mwana jwabhe Ayesu Akilisito Hangwana bhitu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpwilingano kwa bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Ndendakumpembeleanga akaanung'una bhangu, mu lihina lya Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Akilisito, mmangange pamo mu ngani yoa hiinnongelanga, ili pakotokubhee na mpwilingano pakati jinunji. Mmangange chilebhe chimo na kuganikila kumo. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Akaanung'una bhangu bhamwahobhalela Akilisito, ngani hiniipatite kubhoka kwa bhandu bhangi na kwa akaalongo bha Akaloe, hitendakulangia kubhee gubhii bulwa pakati jinunji. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Mbala kulongela henela, kila mundu pakati jinunji alongela chaakwe. Jumo kulongela, “Nenga ndendakwakonda Apaulo,” jongi, “Nenga ndendakwakonda Apolo,” jongi, “Nenga ndendakwakonda Akefa,” na jongi, “Nenga ndendakwakonda Akilisito.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Bholi, Akilisto atekumetunika mu hibhoga hibhoga? Bholi, Apaulo nga jwaakabhambwa panchalaba ligongo linunji? Bholi, nkabatichwanga ili mmangange bhabhachijigana bha Apaulo?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Ndendakwaachukulu Annoongo kubhee nangabaticha mundu joajola pakati jinunji ila nakaabatichanga Akilisipo na Agayo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Henela jwakwa pakati jinunji jwaakombola kulongela kubhee akabatichwa ili abhee jwaachijigana jwangu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Eloo ndekombokela, nakabaticha na akaalongo bha Asitefano, nambo kupunda bhenaangota ngakombokela handa nakabaticha mundu jongi joajola. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Akilisito jwanganduma kubaticha, ila andumite kutangacha Ngani Jammbone, kabhele ndangache pangali kulupalila malango ga bhandu bhangi, ili machili ga malilo ga Akilisito panchalaba gakotokubhonekanga ngabha chilebhe.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akilisito nga machili na malango ga Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Kwa kubhee malagilo kwa ngani ja kujomoka kwa Akilisito panchalaba nga chilebhe changalimaana kwa bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge mu nkutuli gwa kuhobha, nambo kwaachitu twenga tutubhii mu ndela ja kuokoka, malagilo genago nga machili ga Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Kwa kubhee Majaandiko ga Annoongo galobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Mbakugahalibia malango gabhenji bhabhakwetinge malango</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na umanyo gwa bhabhabhilinge na umanyo mbakugutenda ngabha chilebhe.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Abhikoji, jwaabhii na malango? Abhikoji jwaamanya Malagilo? Na abhikoji jwaakombola kulongela hilebhe hijingi? Annoongo agatendite malango ga pachilambo kubhee ngabha chilebhe.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Annoongo nga jwaabhile na malango, na bhandu ngakombolanga kwaamanya Annoongo kwa kulupalila malango gabhenji akaachinabhene. Ila Annoongo atukutumia malobhe ga Hangwana Ayesu kwahokoanga bhandu, malobhe gagabhonekana kwa bhandu bhangi handa ngabha chilebhe, nambo bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela malobhe genago gatutangacha bhatendakuhokolewanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Bhayahudi bhaloleanga hilolelo ili bhakombolange kuhobhalela, na Bhagiliki bhaloleanga malango ili bhakombolange kuhobhalela, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />nambo twenga tutendakuntangacha Ayesu jwaakabhambwa panchalaba, kwa Bhayahudi chilebhe chenjeni nga chiibhilo, na kwa Bhagiliki nga kupelela malango. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Nambo kwa bhenibhala bhabhakemwitinge na Annoongo, bhabhee Bhayahudi au Bhagiliki, Akilisito nga machili na malango ga Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Henela, chichibhonekana ngabha chilebhe kwa Annoongo chibhile na malango muno kupunda malango ga bhandu, na kukabha kwa Annoongo kujangula gubhii na machili muno kupunda machili ga bhandu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Akaanung'una bhangu, nkombokelange penipala pankakemwanga na Annoongo, bhajingi pakati jinunji mwakibhanga mwangali malango hata kwa maganikilo ga chimundu, bhajingi mwakibhanga mwangali machili na bhajingi mwakibhanga mwangabhelekwanga mu akaalongo bhabhakolotinge malola. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Nambo Annoongo akahagula hilebhe hiibhonekana ngabha chilebhe pachilambo ili abhalekelange honi bhandu bhabhakolitinge malango, Annoongo akaiyagula hilebhe yanga machili pachilambo ili abhalekelange honi bhandu bhabhabhilinge na machili. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Annoongo atekugaagula genigala yakubhee kwa maganikilo ga bhandu bha pachilambo nga hibhonekana ngabha chilebhe na hiibhelulikwa, na hilebhe yene yakwa, ili kwa genago agahutile kutali genigala yakubhee kwa maganikilo ga bhandu nga hibhonekana hilebhe yammbone muno. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Akatenda henela ili mundu joajola akotokuchilumbalila nnongi ja Annoongo kubhee akweti malango au nga jwaambone muno. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ila Annoongo mwene nga jwaatekunnondekana mwangota na Akilisito Ayesu, Annoongo antendite Akilisito abhee malango gitu. Kupetela jonojwe twenga tutendakondekwa na Annoongo, tutendakubhee bhandu bhabhe Annoongo bheene na kuokolewa. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Bahi, handa chigalobhola Majaandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">“Jwaajola jwaapala kuchipuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">na achipunile lihengo lya Hangwana libhatendite.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwaatangacha Akilisito jwaakabhambwa panchalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Akaanung'una bhangu, nenga panakahika kwaajinunji, nangantangachianga ngani ya kweli ya Annoongo, na nangatumia malobhe ga kupenya penya au kwa malango ga bhandu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Panakibha na mwangota mbalita ngotokuchimanyanga chilebhe choachela, nambo mbalita naamanye Ayesu Kilisito jikajabhe, jwaakabhambwa panchalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Nenga nakahika kwaachinunji nakachibhona ngakombola kutenda genigala goa yakubhee Akilisito akapala mbangane, kongo mii na bhoga na kulendemela ligongo linunji. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Gandendita kulongela na kujigana nangabhoa malobhe ga kwaabhajila bhandu na ga malango, na ndendakulongela gangani kulangia ndendakulongolelwa na machili ga Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Nakapangana henela ligongo lya kuhobhalela kwitu kukombole kulupalila machili ga Annoongo na ngabha malango ga bhandu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malango ga Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Hata henela, twenga tukatumia malobhe ga malango kwa bhandu bhenibhala bhabhakomilinge chimboomo, nambo malango genago ngabha ga pamba pachilambo, wala ngabha malango gagabhoka bhatawala bha chilambo chenjeni bhabhabhilinge mu nkutuli gwa kuhobha. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Malango gatugatumia nga malango ga kweli ga Annoongo, Annoongo akapala kutenda genago kubhokela kandai ligongo lya ukolo gwitu twenga. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Jwakwa hata atabhala jumo bha machobha gitu jwaakachimanya chikubho chenjeni. Handa bhakaimanyitinge, bhakaabhambitehopo Hangwana bha ukolo. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Nambo, handa chigalobhola Majaandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Hilebhe yakubhee mundu jwangagabhona, wala mundu jwangagajoanikia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">hata mundu jwangakombola kugaganikila muntima gwabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">gangani nga Annoongo gaatekwapanganikianga bhabhampala.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Nambo hikubho yenjeni Annoongo atekutuhunukulila kwa ndela ja Mboomo jwabhe. Mboomo kulolekea kila chilebhe, hata hikubho ya nkati muno ya Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nga ganiki jwaakombola kumanya hikubho ya nkati ja mundu ila nga mboomo jabhe mundu jonojwe? Hela hela mboomo ja Annoongo nga jwamanya hikubho ya nkati ya Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Nangocheni twenga twangapokela mboomo ja pachilambo, ila tupokilinge Mboomo jwaabhoka kwa Annoongo ili atujangatile kugamanya genigala gatupatite kubhoka kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Bahi, twenga tujigana ngabha kwa malobhe gatukajiganwa na malango ga bhandu, ila nga malobhe gatukajiganwa na Mboomo, tubhikujigana hikubho ya chimboomo kwa bhabhabhilinge na jono Mboomo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Mundu jwangaahobhalela Annoongo ngapokela hikubho ya Mboomo jwa Annoongo. Kwabhe mundu jonojwe nga changalimmbone, na jonojwe ngakoombola kugaelewa, ligongo genago gaeleweka tu kwa kujangatilwa na Mboomo. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Nambo mundu jwaatandaikwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo akoombola kuhukumula kila chilebhe, nambo bhenibhala bhangatandaikwa na mboomo jwa Annoongo ngakombolanga kumanya hikubho hiipanganikwa na bhenibhala bhabhatandaikwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Majaandiko galobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Nga ganiki jwaakombola kumanya luunda lwa Hangwana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Nga ganiki jwaakombola kwaalobholela Annoongo chilebhe chakupangana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:16">Nambo twenga tubhii na luunda lwa Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Akaatumichi bha Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Akaanung'una bhangu bhamwahobhalela Kilisito, nenga nangakoombola kunnyigananga mwangota handa bhandu bhankwetinge na jono Mboomo, nambo ikapalikwa kunnyigananga mwangota handa bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo, handa bhana ilemba mu kwahobhalela Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Nakannyigananga hikubho ya kupepeka handa kambombe pabhaanyongea mwana jwabhe, nangampekeanga chaakulya chakulimba, kwakubhee mwakibhanga tangu kuchipokela. Na hata nangocheni ngakombolanga kuchipokelanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ligongo tangu mwangota ntamanga handa bhandu bha chilambo heche chibhatamanga. Kwakubhee tangu gubhii bwihu na kupwatanilana pakati jinunji! Hikubho heyo hilaangia pangali kuhiya kubhee mwangota tangu nga bhandu bhantamanga handa bhandu bha chilambo cheche chibhatamanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Kwakubhee jumo pakati jinunji pabhalobhola, “Nenga ndendakwaakonda Apaulo,” na jongi, “Nenga ndendakwaakonda Apolo,” bholi, heyo ngalaangia kubhee ntamanga handa bhandu bha pachilambo chibhatamanga?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Bholi, Apolo nga ganiki? Na bholi, Apaulo nga ganiki? Twenga nga akaatumichi bha Annoongo bhatutendakunyangatila mwangota ili nkombolange kwahobhalela Akilisito. Kila jumo pakati jitu atenda lihengo libhalipatite kubhoka kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Nenga ngapanda mbeju, Apolo akajitila machi, nambo Annoongo nga jwaakatenda jene mbeju jikoombole kumela. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Henela jonijola jwaapandite na jonijola jwaakajitila machi ngabha chilebhe, jwaatendite lihengo likolongwa nga Annoongo tu jwaajikombolea mbeju kumela. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Mundu jwapanda mbeju alandana na jonijola jwaajitila machi, kila jumo apakulepwa kubhokana na lihengo libhaliteendite. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Ndendakulongela henela kwa kubhee lihengo litutendakupangana nga ja Annoongo na mwangota na ng'onda gwabhe. Twenga nga akaalongo, tututendakupangana mahengo pamo na Annoongo, kabhele nga nyuumba jabhe.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwa kujangatilwa na umbole gwa Annoongo, ndekubhee jwakujemeka kuntangachiaga mwangota Ngani Jammbone ja Akilisito handa henela achengi jwaamanya kuchenga pabhajemeka kuchenga nyuumba. Nangocheni bhabhajigana bhangi bhaika kunnyigananga handa henela akaachengi bhangi chibhachenganga panani jakwe. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Jwaakwa mundu jwaagaletite majigano gangi kwa kubhee majigano gayene gabhile tiyali nga Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Bhena bhabhajigana majigano ga Ayesu nga handa akaachengi bhabhachenganga nyuumba kwa kutumia bhunyu, mbiya au maganga ga bei ngolongwa, nambo bhabhajigana bhabhangajigana majigano gabhe maha nga handa akaachengi bhabhachenganga nyuumba kwa kutumia mikongo, mahamba au manyai. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Kwa kubhee lichobha helyo kila lihengo lya mundu lipakubhonekana na kupemwa. Lipakupemwa kwa mooto, na gono mooto gupakulenga kupema lihengo lya kila mundu. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Handa lihengo lya mundu ngatinika mu goono mooto, apakupokela ngwahupa. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Nambo handa lihengo lya mundu lipakutinika mu mooto, ngapata ngwahupa, nambo jono mweene apakuokolewa handa henela mundu jwaacholopwike pa mooto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee mwangota nga Nyuumba ja Annoongo, na kubhee Mboomo ja Annoongo jitama nkati jinunji? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Mundu jwapakujialibiana Nyuumba ja Annoongo, Annoongo apakunkoma jono mundu, kwakubhee Nyuumba ja Annoongo nga Nyuumba jabhe mwene, na Nyuumba ja Annoongo jenejo nga mwangota akaachinabhene.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Nkotokuchitembanga. Mundu joajola pakati jinunji handa achibhonite atekola malango pachilambo pani, hipaalikwa abhe jwangali malango ili akombole kubhee na malango ga kweli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Kwakubhee malango ga bhandu bha chilambo heche nga gangali gammbone nnongi ja Annoongi. Kwakubhee Majaandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Annoongo atendakwaakamulanga akaakola malango mu kupenya kwabhenji.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Na kabhele, “Hangwana haimanyi kubhee kuganikia kwabhenji akaakola malango ngabha chilebhe.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Henela, mundu joajola akotokuchipunila chenichela chibhapangananga bhandu, kwakubhee hilebhe yoha nga yinunji. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Nkotokuchipunila hilebhe hiipanganikwe na Apaulo na Apolo na Apetulo, chilambo, umomi na kujomoka, hikubho ya nangocheni na hikubho hiika, goha nga gigunji. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Nambo mwangota nga bhandu bhabhe Kilisito, na jono Akilisito nga jwa Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Akaandundame bha Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Annoongo atekututuma twenga tukaalobholelange bhandu malobhe gabhe yakubhee jwangaalobholela mundu joajola. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Chichipalikwa kwa mundu joajola jwaatekupekewa lihengo lya kwaatangachianga bhandu apalikwa kubhee jwaakuaminika. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Nambo kwangu nenga nga chilebhe chichoko muno handa bhandu bhapakunhukumula handa mbangine lihengo maha au nangapangana lihengo maha, au mbakuhukumulwa na chebule joajola ja bhandu, na wala ngachihukumula nenga namwene. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Nenga ngajogopa chikubho choachela, nambo jenejo ngalaangia kubhee nangalemwa. Hangwana jika jabhe nga jwanhukumula. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Henela nkotokuhukumulanga mundu joajola machobha gakwe tangu gangahika, nnendelange mpaka Hangwana pabhapakuhika. Jonojwe apakuileta panhana hilebhe yeniyela hiitekuchiiya palubhendu na kubheka palugwinjili na genigala gabhaganikianga bhandu mu mitima jabhenji. Ngapena kila jumo apakulumbaliwa muno na Annoongoo.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Bahi akaanung'una bhangu, hikubho heye niitendite kubhee kulandana na nenga na Apolo ili gannyangatilange mwangota, mbala mugajeketelange genigala gagajandikwe, “Mugakoondange gagajaandikwe.” Pakati jinunji pakoto kubhee na mundu joajola jwaachipunila mundu jumo na kwaabhelua bhangi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Bholi, nga aganiki jwatekuntenda mwenga kubhe nkolongwa? Chilebhe niki chimwangapekewa? Na handa mpekiwe na Annoongo kwa niki nchipune?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Nangocheni mminago genigala goha gampalanga? Nangocheni ntekubhee akaakola hilebhe hijingi? Ntekubhee akaakolo, kabhele pangali twenga? Elo, ikabhee maha handa kweli nkabhilinge akaamwenye, ili na twenga tubhee akaamwenye pamo na mwangota. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ng'anikianga Annoongo atutendite twenga akaandundame tubhee bhandu bha kubhelulilwa muno, handa bhandu bhabhahukumulikwe komekwa, kwakubhee tutekubhee handa bhandu bha kuekea nnongi ja bhandu bhoa bha pachilambo choa, nnongi ja akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo na bhandu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Twenga tubhonekana ngabha chilebhe ligongo lya Akilisito, nambo mwangota nga akaakola malango mu kulondekana na Akilisito! Twenga twangali machili, nambo mwangota nga ntekola machili. Mwangota ntendakutopelwa, nambo twenga tutendakutubhelulikwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Mpaka nangocheni tubhii na njala na nyota, twangali ngobho, tupotwa mapalamanda ga kumio na pakwa pakugoloka. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Kabhele tutendakulaga na tutenda mahengo kwa mabhoko gitu twakaachinabhene. Handa bhapakututukana na twaatendelanga gammbone, handa bhapakutubhelua tutendakuhimbalila, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />bhandu pabhatukopokeanga, tutendakujangula kwa kutopea. Mpaka nangocheni tutekutendwa handa uhakwa gwa pachilambo, na pamiho ja bhandu twenga tubhonekana ngabha chilebhe!<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Ngannyandikilanga hilebhe yenjeni ligongo lya kuntendanga mwangota mmangange na honi, nambo nga ligongo lya kwaajigananga bhana bhangu bhanaapalanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Hata handa mmi na bhabhajigana elupu komi mu Akilisito, nambo mwangali akaatati bhajingi. Nenga ngibha naatati bhinu kwa kubhee nga junakaannetelanga Ngani Jammbone.<verse eid="1CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Henela ndendakumpembeleanga mwangota, mmangange handa nenga chimile. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Nga maana naatumite Atimoseo kwaachinunji. Jonojwe nga mwana jwangu junaapala na jwakuaminika mu kulondekana na Hangwana. Apakwakombokeanga ndela jiniikagula mu kulondekana na Akilisito, ndela jininyigana koha mu hibhoga ya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Bhangi pakati jinunji bhajemikinge kubhee bhatekuchilibhalila bhabhikuganikianga kubhee ngahika kabhele kwaachinunji. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Nambo Hangwana anabhapalite, mbakuhika kwaachinunji na popopo nga pambakuchibhonela mwene, ngabha chenichela chibhakombolanga kulongela bhenaangota bhabhachipuna, nambo kabhele chenichela chibhakombolanga kutenda. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kwakubhee ukolo gwa Annoongo ngabha ngani ja kulongela tu, ila kubhee na machili ga Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Mpalanga bholi? Nhike kwaachinunji na luyakato, au nhike na ntima gwa upalio na liele?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Ngoongola ngapalikwa kwa bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Hibhii ngani ya kuaminika kubhee jibhii ngoongola pakati jinunji, nga ngoongola jibohu yakubhee jangabhokela hata pakati ja bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo. Ndekulobholelwa kubhee jumo jwinunji atama na hanu bha atati bhabhe! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Nkombolanga bholi kuchipuna? Wala mwangajoanga mitima kubhina ili kupala mundu jwaatendite chikubho hecho abhoke pakati jinunji. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Nenga, kwa upande gwangu, hata kwa mmele ndekubhee kutali na mwangota, hata henela kwa mboomo mii penapo pamo na mwangota, handa henela hibhii penapo, ndekujomola kwaahukumula mundu jonojwe jwaatendite chikubho chenecho cha honi. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Pamkondekananga pamo kwa kwaachalila Hangwana Ayesu, na nenga mbakubhee pamo na mwangota kwa mboomo, na kwa ukolo gwa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />munkamuange kwa Lichetani mundu jonojwe ili agupote mmele gwabhe na kuntenda mundu jonojwe aleke mabohu gabhe ila mboomo jabhe jikombole kuokolewa mu lichobha lyela lya Hangwana.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kuchipuna kwinunji kwangali maana! Bholi, ngaimanya kubhee ngedule kachoko jikombola kutumungua libonge lyoa lya ukobha gwa ngaano? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Mmekange mitima jinunji kubhee chwaapi ligongo lya kwaachalila Annoongo, mummoange jonijola mundu jwaapangana gabohu ili mkombolange kubhee libonge liyono lya ukobha gwa ngaano lyangalekelwa ngedule handa chimpalikwanga kubhee, kwakubhee Akilisito, Pasaka jitu, atekubhokekwa kubhee mbeeko. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Henela tutende lichobha likolongwa ngabha kwa ngedule jenijela ja lolo, ngedule jangalimmbone na jibohu, ila kwa nkate gwangalekelwa ngedule, nga ntima nchwaapi na kweli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Mu balua jangu nakannyandikilanga kubhee nkotokuchikichana pamo na bhangoongola. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Henela nangannobholelanga nkotokuchikichana na bhandubhoa bha pachilambo, bhandu bha ngongola, au bhandu bhakulokolila, au bhabhapokanga hilebhe na bhabhajopanga hidimu. Henela handa mpalanga kubhee kutali na bhena bhandu mkapalikwa kubhoka mu chilambo heche! <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Chinakannyandikilanga nga chenjeni, nkotokuchikichana na anung'una jwaatekwahobhalela Akilisito jwaatenda ngoongola, bhailema, bhabhajopa hidimu, jwaakololekea akaajabhe, jwakolelwa na jwaapoka hilebhe. Mundu handa jonojwe hata kulyee nkotokulyee pamo nabho.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Bholi, nga lihengo lyangu kwahukumulanga bhandu bhabhangahobhalela Akilisito? Bhenaangota Annoongo apakwahukulanga. Bholi, ngati mpalikwa kwahukumulanga bhandu bhenabho bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhabhabhilinge pakati jinunji? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Mwangota mummengange mu chibhoga chinunji jonojwe abohu.<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Nkotokutakiana mu chebule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Handa mundu atekupwatilana na anung'una jwahobhalela Akilisito ntendakutakiana nnongi ja bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo, badala ja kutakiana nnongi ja bhandu bhabhaamanya Annoongo? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee bhandu bha Annoongo bhapakuhukumula bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo? Na mwangota handa mpakwahukumula bandu bhangaamanya Annoongo, kwa niki ngakombolanga kuhukumula hata mu hilebhe hichokochoko ya kila lichobha mu umomi gwitu? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee, hata kwa kuhukumula mu hilebhe hichoko choko ya kila lichobha mu umomi gwitu, tupakwahukumulanga hata akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Henela handa kubhii kupwatilananga pakati jinunji kwa ngani ja hikubho handa yenjeni, kwa niki ntendakuagulanga bhandu bhangatopelwa mu lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito kubhee akaaliwali? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Nga honi kwinunji! Nga kulobhola jwakwa hata jumo pakati jinunji jwaakweti malango muno jwa kombola kutapulana bulwa pakati ja anung'una jumo na akaajabhenji? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Nambo chichipalikwa, anung'una jumo ampeleke nnyakwe kuchebule, kabhele nnongi ja bhandu bhangahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Konokwe kuhukumulananga akaachinabhenenji kwa akaachibhenenji kulangia kubhee ntekulepelanga! Bholi, hikabheehopo chikubho chammbone muno kwaachinunji kutendelwa gabohu? Hikabheehopo yammbone muno kwaachinunji kumpokonyola hilebhe yinunji? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Nambo badala jabhe, mwangota mwaakachinabhene ntendakutembanga na kwaatendela bhangi gabohu, kabhele ntendakwapokonyola hilebhe bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee bhandu bhangalimmbone ngalekelwa ukolo gwa Annoongo? Nkotokuchitembanga! Bhandu bhabhatamanga umomi gwa ngoongola, bhabhajopanga hidimu, bhaloloi, au akanalome bhabhagolokana akaachinabhene, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />akaabwihi, bhailema, bhakukolelwa, bhakujegeja, bhandu bhabhapalanga hilebhe hijingi hibhee yabhe jika jabhe, bhenaangota bhoa ngajingilanga mu ukolo gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Bhandu bhangi pakati jinunji mwakibhanga henela, nambo nangocheni ntekujelejewa kubhoka mu mabohu, nkatendwanga kubhee bhandu bha Annoongo, na kutendwa bhakutungamanika na kondekwa na Annoongo kupetela Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito na kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo jitu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumiange mimele jinunji kwa ukolo gwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Mundu akombola kulongela, “Kwaachangu nenga kila chilebhe nga chammbone.” Nambo ngabha kila chilebhe nga chichipaalikwa. Eloo ndendakonda kubhee kila chilebhe nga chipaalikwa kwaachangu nambo ngaana kuhukumulikwa na chilebhe choachela. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Mundu jongi akombola kulongela, “Chaakulya nga kwa ligongo lya lutumbo, na lutumbo nga kwa ligongo lya chaakulya.” Nambo Annoongo apakuhialibiana hibhele yoha hibhele. Mmele gwa amundu ngabha kwa ligongo lya ngoongola bali nga kwa ligongo lya lihengo lya kwaatumikila Hangwana, na bhena Annoongo atendakujilolekea mimele jitu na kujipekea chakulya. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Annoongo jwaakaayoa Hangwana Ayesu hela hela nga jwapakutuyoa twenga kwa machili gakwe.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee mimele jinunji nga yeega ya mmele gwa Akilisito? Bholi, ng'anikianga ngombola kutola chipande cha mmele gwa Akilisito na kugutenda kubhee chipande cha mmele gwa bhangoongola? Hata kachoko! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Handa chinchimanyanga mwangota, jwaakondekana pamo na mundu jwa ngoongola kubhee mmele gumo na jonojwe handa chiikajandikwa mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, “Na bhenaangota bhabhele bhapakubhee mmele gumo.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Nambo jwaabhii pamo na Hangwana atendakubhee mboomo jimo na Hangwana. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Nchibhekenge kuatali na ngooongola. Mabohu gangi goha kuteendeka panja ja mmele nambo mundu jwa ngoongola atenda mabohu kupetela mmele gwabhe mweene. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee mimele jinunji nga Nyuumba ja Mboomo ja Annoongo jwaatama nkati jinunji, yakubhee mukampokelanga kubhoka kwa Annoongo? Mwangota bahi, ngabha mimele jinunji ngabha jinunji mwakaachinabhene ila nga jakwe Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Kwa kubhee nkahemelwanga kwa bei ngolongwa. Henela, muitumiange mimele jinunji ligongo lya kwaalumbalila Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Majigano kwa ngani ja ulombela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Bahi, kwa ngani yeniyela hinikanyandikilanga, mwangota nnobholanga, nga yammbone handa mundu ngalombela. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Nambo kwa ligongo lya kujogoa kwa ngoongola, bahi, kila mwanalome na abhee na hanu jwabhe mwene, na kila mwikege abhee na hangwana jwabhe mwene. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Mwananalome apalikwa kwaatendela kila chilebhe chichipalikwa kwa hanu bhabhe, na bhena hanu mundu apaalikwa kwaatendela kila chilebhe chichipalikwa kwa hangwana bhabhe. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Hanu mundu jwangali malola kwa ngani ja mmele gwabhe, bali hangwana bhabhe abhinago, hela hela hangwana mundu jwangali malola kwa ngani ja mmele gwabhe, ila hanu bhabhe abhinago. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Kila mundu akoto kwaajima ajabhe, ila handa nkondikininge kwa machobha gantekondananga, ili nkombolange kuchibhoa mu kwaajopa Annoongo, kabhele mmujilanange ili Lichetani akoto kwaajiganga ligongo lya kulepela kuchiibhila kwinunji.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Gandendakunnobholelanga nangocheni nga genigala gang'anikia nenga jika, ngabha malagilo. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ndendakupala bhandu bhoa bhabhangange handa nenga chinitama, nambo kila jumo akweti chipawa chabhe kubhoka kwa Annoongo, jumo chipawa chabhe chenjeni na bhangi chenichela.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Nangocheni kwa bhenibhala bhangalombelanga na bhenibhala akaawelwa ndendakunnobholela kubhee nga yammbone kubhee handa nenga chinitama. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Handa mundu ngakombola kuchihibhila, bahi na aloombele, kwakubhee nga mbaya muno kulombela au kulombwa nambo ngabha kulokolila.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kwa bhenibhala bhabhatekulombelana ngweti malagilo, kabhele ngabha jangu, ila nga ja Hangwana, hanu na akotokulekana na hangwana bhabhe, <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />nambo handa bhalekininge na bhena, bahi bhaigale hiyoyo pangali kulombwa, handa ngabha henela, achikichane na hangwana bhabhe. Na jono hangwana akoto kwaajandikila na kwaapekea talaka hanu bhabhe.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Nambo kwa bhenaangota bhangi, gangani gandendakulongela ngabha Hangwana jwaatekunobholela ila nenga nga ndekulobhola handa anung'una jwaakweti hanu jwangahobhalela, na jono hanu akakoonda kutama pamo na jonojwe, bahi nkoto kwaapekea talaka. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Na, handa mwikege jwatekwaahobhalela Akilisito abhii na hangwana jwangahobhalela, na jono analome akakonda kutama nabho, bahi, akoto kwaapekea talaka hangwana jwabhe. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kwa kubhee jonojwe hangwana jwangahobhalela Akilisito atendakondekwa kwa Annoongo kwa kulondanika na hanu bhabhe, na jono mwikege jwaangahobhalela Akilisito atendakondekwa kwa Annoongo kwa kulondanika na hangwana bhabhe. Handa ngabha henela bhana bhabhenji bhakakondikweehopo kwa Annoongo, nambo nangocheni bhabhilinge bhana bhakwe Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Nambo handa jonijola jwangahobhalela apala kwaaleka ajabhe jwaatekwaahobhalela Akilisito, bahi, na bhaaleke. Penapo hangwana au hanu jwahobhalile Akilisito, apakutenda umomi gwabhe. Kwakubhee Annoongo atekunkemanga mwangota ntamange kwa kuhengwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Mwenga hanu jwamwahobhalela Akilisito, mpakombolabholi kuimanya handa mpakwahokoa hangwana bhinu? Au mwenga hangwana jwamwahobhalela Akilisito, mpakombolabholi kuimanya handa mpakwahokoa hanu jwinu?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntamange handa chibhatekunkemenga Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Nambo kila mundu atame handa chibhatekulobholelwa na Hangwana, na handa chibhatekemwa na Annoongo. Hele nga lilagilo lyangu kwa hibhoga ya bhandu bhabhaahobhalela Ayesu. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Handa mundu akakemwa kongo abhii ahinitwe, bahi akotokuchikopokea kubhee jwangahinwa, na handa pabhakakemwa abhii tangu kuhinwa, bahi na akotokuhinwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kwa kubhee kuhinwa au pangalikuhinwa ngabha chilebhe, chichibhii chammbone nga kugajoanikia malagilo ga Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Bahi, kila jumo jwinunji na aigalilee handa chibhabhile penipala pabhakakemwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Bholi, mwenga mwakibha abhanda pankakemwa? Elo, nkotokubhee na lipamba, nambo handa mpatite upenyo gwa kulekelelwa, mugutumie. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kwa kubhee jonojwe jwaakemitwe na Hangwana abhii abhanda jonojwe kubhee mundu jwangabhee na mabohu kwa Hangwana. Hela hela jonojwe jwaakemitwe abhii mundu jwangabhee na mabohu, kubhee abhanda kwa Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mwabhoa ntekuhemelwanga kwa bei ngolongwa, nangocheni nkotokubhee kabhele akaabhanda bha bhandu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Akaanung'una bhangu bhamwahobhalela Akilisito, kila jumo jwinunji na aigalile na Annoongo handa chiikabhee lolo penipala pabhakakwemwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani kwa bhangalombelanga na akaawelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Bahi kwa ngani ja akaahenja na akaamwali bhangalombelwanga, nenga nangali amuli kubhoka kwa Hangwana, nambo ndendakuganikia kubhee kwa kiha jabhe Hangwana mpalikwa kunhobhalela.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Bahi, kubhokana na ngani jijibhile nangocheni, nga yammbone nhigalange handa chimmilinge. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Bholi, nnombile? Bahi, nkotokuganikia kulekana na hanu bhinu. Bholi, mwangaloombela? Bahi, nkotokulolea mwikege. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Nambo handa nnombile, mpakubhee mwangatenda mabohu, na mwaali handa alombwite, apakubhee jwangatenda mabohu, nambo bhenibhala bhabhapakulombelananga bhapakupatanga ukomu nnyingi mu umomi gongoni, na nenga mbala genago gakotokumpatanga mwangota.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Akaanung'una bhangu bhamwahobhalela Akilisito mbala kulongela henela, muda guguhigalile nga nnyipinyipi. Na kubhokela nangocheni bhenibhala bhabhalombilinge na bhatamange handa henela bhangalombelananga, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />bhabhagutanga bhabhee handa ngagutanga hopo, na bhabhahachukanga bhabhee handa ngahachukanga hopo, bhabhahemelanga bhabhee handa ngahemelanga chilebhe, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />bhoa bhabhabhilinge na lihengo pachilambo pani bhabhee handa bhangali lihengo. Kwakubhee chilambo cheni, handa chitumanya chipakupeta.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Chimbala nenga mwangota nkotokubhee na lipamba. Mundu jwangalombela apakupangana lihengo lya Hangwana henela chibhapakwabhajila Hangwana. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Nambo analome jwaalombile apangana hilebhe ya pachilambo, ili ammajile hanu mundu, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />na jono kuganikia kwabhe kutekumetunika pabhele. Mwikege jwangalombelwa au ahenja atendakuchibhoa mweene ligongo lya kupangana lihengo lya Hangwana. Nambo mwikege jwaalombwite atendakupangana hilebhe ya pachilambo pani ili ammajile hangwana mundu.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ndendakunnobholelanga gangani kupala kunnyangatilanga mwangota, na ngabha kunhibhilanga. Mbala ntamange maha, ili muntumikile Hangwana mitima jinunji joa.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Handa mundu joajola atendakuganikia kubhee ngaatendela gammbone handa ngannombela jono mwikege jwaatekwaaloa, kongo yaaka ya jono mwikege pahipunda kujonjokeka na jono mundu kulikolila kwabhe, bahi apangane handa chibhapala, ngapenda bhalombelanange tu. Jonojwe apakubhee jwangapanga mabohu, bhapaalikwa bhatoolane tu. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Nambo handa jono mwanalome handa apaalite mweene mu ntima gwakwe ngaloombela pangali kulumikilwa na mundu joajola, na handa akoombola kuchitandaa mweene, bahi atenda maha pangali kunnombela jono mwikege ahenja. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Kwa malobhe gangi, jonijola mwanalome jwaamua kulombela atenda yammbone na jonijola jwaamua kutama pangali kulombela atenda yammbone muno.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mwikege jwaalombwite atabhitwe na malagilo ga ulombela kwa machobha goa hangwana bhabhe pabhabhee jwamomi. Nambo hangwana mundu handa atekujomoka, mwikege jonojwe ngatabhwa na malagilo ga hangwana mundu, na handa apaalite kulombwa na analome jongi joajola jwaapalite, ila hipaalikwa abhee mwanalome jwaahobhalela Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Nambo chimmona nenga, apakuhachuka muno handa apakuhigalila hiyoyo handa apakutama pangali kulombwa kabhele na mwanalome joajola. Genago ngabha gang'anikia nenga, na ngweti Mboomo jwa Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Yaakulya hiibhokilwe chadaka kwa hidimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Nangocheni kwa ngani ja yaakulya hiibhokilwe chadaka kwa hidimu, tuimanyi kubhee, “Twenga twabhoa tubhii na umanyo,” nambo kumanya konokwe kwaatenda bhandu bhachipunange, nambo upalio gututenda twaajangatilange bhangi. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Mundu joajola jwaaganikia kubhee atendakumanya chilebhe, jonojwe ngachimanya choachela handa chibhapalikwa kumanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Nambo jwaampala Annoongo, Annoongo atendakummanya mundu jonojwe.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Henela, kwa ngani ya chakulya chichibhokelwa chadaka kwa hidimu, tuimanyi kubhee hidimu ngabha chilebhe pamba pachilambo na tuimanya kubhee Annoongo nga jumo jika. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Hata handa bhabhilinge bhabhakemwanga, “Minongo,” kunani kwa Annoongo au pachilambo, na hata handa kweli bhabhilinge “minongo,” na “akaangwana,” bhajingi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />henela, kwaachitu twenga abhile Annoongo jumo jika, Atati, jwaalakie yoha, na ligongo lyabhe twenga tubhile. Kabhele abhile Hangwana jumo jika, Ayesu Kilisito, kwa kupetela jonojwe hilebhe yoha hikaahalakilwa, na twenga tutendakutama ligongo lyabhe.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Nambo ngabha kila mundu jwaachimanya chikubho heche. Bhena bhandu tangu bhatekuyobhalela kubhee mpaka nangocheni pabhalyanganga chakulya kuchibhona handa chakulya chichitekubhokelwa chadaka kwa hidimu. Kwa kubhee kuganikia kwabhenji kuchoko, bhachibhonanga bhatendanga chikubho changakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Nambo chakulya ngakombola kutupeleka kubhandikila muno na Annoongo. Handa tulekite kulyee ngapongokewa chilebhe, handa tulile ngajonjokewa chilebhe kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Nambo nnolange gongoni ukolo gwinunji gukoto kwaachimwanga bhenibhala bhabhangabhee na machili mu kuhobhalela bhatendange mabohu. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Kwakubhee, mundu jwangakomala mu kuhobhalela, handa amweni mwenga junkweti umanyo ntendakulyee yakulya yeneyo nkati ja nyuumba ya hidimu, bholi, mundu jonojwe ngakulumikilwa kulyee chakulya chichitekubhokelwa chadaka kwa hidimu? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Henela, anang'una jwangakomala mu kuhobhalela yakubhee Akilisito akajomoka ligongo lyabhe, apakuhobha ligongo lya umanyo gwinu. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Pamwajambukianga kupangana mabohu akaanung'una bhinunji kwa ndela jenejo na kwahulaa mu kuhobhalela kwabhenji kwangakomala, mpakwalemwa Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Henele, handa chakulya chipakwaatenda anung'una jwangu kutenda mabohu, ngalyee nyama ng'o, ndendakujogopa kwajambukia anung'una jwangu kutenda mabohu.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Mahengo gagapalikwa kupekewa andundame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Bholi, nenga ndekutabhwa? Bholi, nenga nga naandundame? Bholi, nenga nangaabhona Ayesu Hangwana bhitu? Bholi, nenga ngabha jundekunnongoleanga kwahobhalela Ayesu? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Hata handa kwa bhandu bhangi nenga ngabha andundame, nambo nenga nga naandundame kwaachinu! Ligongo umomi gwinunji gutendakulangia undundame gwangu kwaachinu, ligongo lya kulondanika kwinunji na Hangwana.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Kwa bhenibhala bhandu bhabhandauka ndendakuchitetea henela. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Bholi, nenga ngapalikwa kupekewa chakulya? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Bholi, ngapaalikwa kulongana na hanu jwaatekuhobhalela Akilisito mu ulendo gwangu, handa chibhatendanga akaandundame bhangi na akaanung'una bhabhe Ayesu na Akefa kwa lihina lyengi nga Apetulo? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Bholi, nenga na Abalinaba nga bhatupalikwa kutenda mahengo ili tukombole kutama? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Bholi, nga linyemba niki lilijenda kungondo kwa kuchilepela mweene? Alemi niki jwangalyee matunda ga ng'onda gwabhe gwa mzabibu? Achungi niki jwangang'wee mabhele ga hilangwa yabhe?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Bholi, ndendakulongela hikubho heye kwa kuganikia chimuundu? Au bholi, Malagilo ga Annoongo gabhaapekie Amusa ngalongela henela? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Tuchoomite mu Malagilo ga Annoongo gabhaapekie Amusa, “Nkotokuntabha ng'oombe pabhatendakutumika kupukuchula ngaano.” Bholi, pambani Annoongo alongela kwa ngani ja ng'oombe jika? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Bholi, Annoongo pabhakalongela malobhe genago ngalongela ligongo litu? Kweli gajaandikwe ligongo litu, kwa kubhee jwaalema na jonijola jwahuna, bhoa bhabhele bhatendakulupalila kubhee bhapakupatanga chakulya. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ikabhii twenga tutekuntangachianga malobhe ga Annoongo pakati jinunji, bholi, chipakubhee chikubho chikolongwa ikibha tupakupata hilebhe ya pammeele kubhoka kwaachinu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Handa bhangi bhatendakondekwa kulolekea genago kubhoka kwaachinu, bholi, twenga ngakondekwa kuliko bhenaangota?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Nambo, twenga twangakondekwa mu genago. Nambo tupalikwa kuchitimalika kwa kila chilebhe ili tukoto kuhibhila Ngani Jammbone ja Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee bhandu bhabhatumikila Nyuumba ja Annoongo bhapatanga chakulya chabhenji kubhoka mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, na bhabhapianga chadaka paamecha ja kubhokea mbeeko bhalyenganga chenichela chichibhokekwa pameecha jenejo? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Hangwana akanagikia hela hela, bhabhatangacha Ngani Jammbone bhapatange chenichela chibhapalanga kubhoka mu Ngani Jammbone jenejo.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Nambo, nenga nangatumia hata kachoko kondekwa konokwe. Na nenga nangannyandikilanga hikubho heye kongo mii kuhobhalela kubhee mpakundendelanga hikubho yeneyo. Mbaya nyomoke kuliko kuntenda mundu joajola abhone kubhee ndendakuchilumbalila. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Nambo pandenda kutangacha Ngani Jammbone ngakombola kuchilumbalila kwakubhee mbalikwa kutangacha. Na kulaga kupakubhee kwaachangu handa ngatangacha Ngani Jammbone! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Handa mbakutangacha kwa kupala namwene, bahi, ndendakulupalila kulepwa, nambo kwa kubhee ndenda kupanga handa lihengo lyangu namwene, ligongo Annoongo atekumbekea lihengo helye mbangane. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Bahi malepo gangu nga chiniki? Malepo gangu nga upenyo gwa kutangacha Ngani Jammbone pangali kulepwa, pangali kulonga kondekwa kubhokana na lihengo lya kutangacha.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Handa chiibhile, nenga ngabha mmanda jwa mundu joajola, nambo ndekuchitenda kubhee mmanda bha kila mundu, ili ngombole kwaajangatilanga bhandu bhajingi bhakombolange kwaahobhalela Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Kwa Bhayahudi ngibha handa Ayahudi, ili ngombole kwapatanga Bhayahudi. Kwa bhandu bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge pahi ja malagilo, ngibha handa jwabhile pahi ja malagilo, ili ngombole kwapatanga bhandu bhabhabhii pahi ja malagilo. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, ndekutama handa bhenaangota, ili ngombole kwaajangatilanga kwahobhalela Akilisito. Jenjeni jilangia kubhee nenga ngajoanikia na malagilo ga Annoongo, ila ndendakulongolelwa na malagilo ga Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Kwa bhandu bhanga chilebhe nanenga ngachitenda handa mundu jwanga chilebhe ili ngombole kwaajangatilanga bhenibhala bhanga chilebhe bhakombolange kwahobhalela Ayesu. Ndekutenda kila chilebhe kwa bhandu bhoa ili ngombole kwaaokoanga bhangi pakati jabhenji kwa kila ndela.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Ndendite haga goa ligongo lya Ngani Jammbone, ili nenga na bhaoa bhabhapakwahobhalela tupatange gammbone ga Ngani Jammbone. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Bholi, ngaimanyanga kubhee, mu lubhanja lwa kukinila, bhandu bhabhabhutukanga nga bhajingi, nambo nga jumo tu jwaatola ngwahupa? Henela mmutukange ili mkombolange kupatanga ngwahupa. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Bhabhabhutukanga bhachibhekanga maha kwa machobha gajingi ili lichobha lyela lya kuchindana, ili bhalombolange kupokela ngwahupa jijihalibika! Nambo twenga tupangana hela hela ili tukombole kupata ngwahupa jangahalibika. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Henela nenga ngabhutuka handa mundu jwabhutuka ili kupokela ngwahupa, ngapotana handa mundu jwapota penipala pangali chilebhe. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Bahi, ndendakugulagia mmele gwangu na kugutumikicha ili penipala panaatangachianga bhandu bhangi Ngani Jammbone, ngotokubhee mundu jwakanikwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Nkotokuhobhalela hidimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Akaanung'una bhangu, mbala muimanyange kubhee akanahota bhitu bhoa ndendita kwalolekea nenga, nga maana bhoa bhakajombokanga maha bahali ja Shamu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Bhoa bhakabatichwanga ili bhabhangange bhandu bhabhaakagula Amusa mu lyenilyela lihunde na mu jenijela bahali. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Bhoa bhakalyenganga chakulya chela chela cha chimboomo chichibhokile kunani kwa Annoongo, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />na bhoa bhakangw'enganga ching'welo chela chela cha chimboomo chichibhokile kunani kwa Annoongo, kwa maana bhakang'wenganga kubhoka mu gonigola luhala lwa mboomo gubhakalongananabho, na gonigola luhala lukibha nga Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Nambo bhandu bhanjingi bhangapangana genigala gabhagapala Annoongo, henela bhakajomokanga na mimele jabhenji jikajenela palikonja.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Nangocheni, hikubho heye yoa nga handa kulandanakia tu kwaachitu, kutendakutukelebhua twenga ili tukoto kulokolila kupangana hikubho hibohu handa bhenaangota chibhakalokolilanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Nkoto kubhee bhandu bha kuchalila hidimu handa bhangi pakati jabhenji chibhakatendanga, handa chiijandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, “Bhandu bhakatamanga pahi kulyee na kung'wee, bhakajemanga kuhina handa bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Wala tukoto kutenda ngoongola handa bhangi pakati jabhenji chibhakatendanga na bhakajomokanga bhandu elupu ishilini na tatu kwa lichobha limo. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Tukoto kwaajiga Hangwana handa bhangi pakati jabhenji chibhatendanga, bhakajomokanga kwa kulumwa na majoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Bahi mwangota nkotokokolekanga handa bhangi pakati jabhenji chibhakakokolekanga, Annoongo akaatuma antumichi jwabhe jwa kunani jwa koma bhandu, akaakomanga.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Hikubho heye yoa hikaapatanga bhenaangota ili ibhee ngelebhuo kwa bhangi, na gakajandikwa ili kutujigana twenga bhatutama kubhandikila na kupela kwa chilambo.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Henela, jonojwe jwaaganikia ajemite maha mu kuhobhalela kwabhe, achilolekee ili akotokugwee kwa kupangana gabohu. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Malengelo gamugapatite ngabha gakulimba kwa bhandu. Annoongo nga jwakuhaminika, najombe ngalekelea nlengekwange kupeta machili ginunji. Nambo pannengekwanga atakwapekeanga ndela ja kuhimbalila ili mmokange monomwe maha.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Henela, akaaganja bhangu, nchibhekange kutali na kuchalila hidimu. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nongela na mwangota, handa bhandu bhammilinge na malango, nchiagulilange akaachinabhene gangani gandendakunnobholelanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Bholi, patwaachukulu Annoongo kwa chikombe chela cha umbone, ngang'wee chikombe chimo na Akilisito? Nkate gonigola gutugumetula, ngalyee pamo na Akilisito? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kwa kubhee nkate nga gumo, handa twenga chitubhile bhajingi nga mmele gumo, na bhoa tutendakuchikichana mu nkate gumo.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Mwalolange bhandu bha ku Isilaeli, bhenibhala bhabhalyenganga chichibhokilwe mbeeko bhatendakulondanikanga na meecha jenejo jijitekuhalakilwa ligongo lya kubhokea mbeeko. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Bahi nongele bholi? Kubhee chakulya chichitekubhokelwa hidimu nga chilebhe chammbone muno kupunda chakulya? Na yene hidimu, bholi, kweli nga chilebhe chammbone muno kupunda hidimu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Hopo! Chinnongela nenga nga kubhee mbeeko hibhabhoanga bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo bhatendakwabhokea mahoka, nambo ngabha Annoongo. Nenga mbalahopo mwangota nchikichanange na mahoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ngakombolanga kung'wee chikombe cha Hangwana na hela hela kung'wee chikombe cha mahoka, ngakombolanga kuchikichana mu lichobha likolongwa lya Chakulya cha Hangwana pa mecha ja mahoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Bholi, tupala kujimua bwihu gwa Hangwana? Bholi, ng'anikianga twenga tukweti machili kupunda Hangwana?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Twenga twangatabhikwa kupangana kila chilebhe, nambo ngabha yoa nga yammbone. Hilebhe yoa nga yammbone nambo ngabha yoa hiitendakwaajangatila bhandu. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Mundu joajola akotokulolea gagabhile gabhe mwene, nambo kila mundu alolee genigala gagaajangatilanga bhangi.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Nlyangange nduli jijihuchwa kuchoko, pangali konya konya, ligongo lya kujogopa kuchihulaa ntima. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kwa kubhee mu Majandiko ga Annoongo ijaandikwe, “Chilambo na yoa hiibhile nkati jabhe nga hilebhe ya Hangwana.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Mundu jwangahobhalela handa apakunnalikanga na mwangota handa nkonditinge kujaula, bahi, nlyangange yoa hiibhatekumpanganikianga pangali konya konya ligongo lya kujogopa kuchihulaa ntima. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Nambo mundu handa apakunnobholelanga, “Henje nduli jitekubhokekwa mbeeko kwa hidimu,” bahi, nkotokulyenganga ligongo lya jonojwe jwaatekunnobholelanga henela, na ili nkotokuchihulaa mu mitima jinunji. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Pambani ndendakulongela ngabha ligongo lya kuhulaa genigala gang'anikiaga mwenga, chinongela nenga nga ligongo lya kuguhulaa ntima gwa jonojwe jwaatekunnobholela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Mpakungonyanga, “Kwa niki gambala kupangana nenga gatendakulupalila kuganikia kwa mundu jongi? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ikabhile nenga ndendakulyee chakulya chenecho kongo mmikwachukulu Annoongo, kwa niki nongelwe kwa malobhe gangali mmbone kwa kwaachukulu Annoongo kwa heche chibhatekumbekea?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Bahi, choachela chintekupangananga handa kulyee au kung'wee, mpanganange yoa ligongo lya kwaalumbalila Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Nkotokokwajambukianga Bhayahudi au Bhagiliki au hibhoga ya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhatendange mabohu. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Mmangange handa nenga, ndendakujiga kwaabhajila bhandu bhoa kwa kila ndela, kwa kubhee ngalolea hikubho yammbone ligongo lyangu namweene nambo nga ligongo lya bhajingi bhapatange kuhokolelewa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Nyiigange nenga handa nenga chindendakwajiga Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwekela mutwe pantendakwaachalila Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Ndendakunnumbalilanga kwa kubhee ntendakungombokelanga mu kila chikubho na kwa kukamula majigano ganimpekiinge. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Nambo mbala muimanyange kubhee mutwe gwa kila mwanalome nga Akilisito, na mutwe gwa kila mwikege nga hangwana bhabhe, na mutwe gwa Akilisito nga Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Kila mwanalome jwaajopa au jwatangacha Ngani ja Annoongo kongo abhi awekile mutwe gwabhe, jonojwe atendakwabhelua Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Kila mwikege jwaajopa au kutangacha Ngani ja Annoongo pangali kuwekela mutwe gwabhe, atendakwabhelua hangwana bhabhe, jwaatenda henela jwalandana na mwikege jwaatekuchekula mutwe gwabhe. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Mwikege jwangawekela mutwe gwabhe, nga mbaya achekule majungu gakwe. Nambo handa nga honi kwa mwikege kuchekula mwajungu gakwe, bahi nga mbaya awekele mutwe gwabhe. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Ngapalikwa kwa mwanalome kuwekela mutwe gwabhe, kwa kubhee mwanalome nga nnandanikio gwa Annoongo kulangia ukolo gwa Annoongo, nambo mwikege nga kulangia ukolo gwa mwanalome. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Mwanalome jwangahalakikwa kubhoka kwa mwikege, nambo mwikege atekulakikwa kubhoka kwa mwanalome. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Mwanalome jwangahalakikwa ligongo lya kwaajangatila mwikege, nambo mwikege akahalakikwa ligongo lya kwaajangatila mwanalome. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ligongo mwikege kuwekela mutwe gwabhe, chibhee chilolelo cha ukolo gugubhile kwa ngani jakwe, na hela hela ligongo lya kwaachuanga akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Hata henela, nnongi ja Hangwana mwikege ngakombola kumkulupalila mwanalome, na jonojwe mwanalome ngakombola kumkulupalila mwikege. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Handa henela mwikege chiatekuhalakikwa kubhoka kwa mwanalome, hela hela mwanalome atendakubhelekwa na mwikege, nambo kila chilebhe chibhoka kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Nhukumulange mwakaachinabhene, bholi, nga yammbone mwikege kwaajopa Annoongo pangali kuwekela mutwe gwabhe? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Hata bhandu chibhatekuhalakikwa jilangia pandaa kubhee kwa mwanalome kubhee na majungu matandamao nga honi kwaache mwene, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />nambo kwa mwikege kubhee na majunju matandamao nga ukolo kwaachabhe. Kwa kubhee mwikege apatite mwajungu matandamao ili gaawekele. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Handa mundu apala kutauka kwa ngani ja chikubho heche, na aimanye kubhee twenga pamo na mabhoga ga bhandu bhabhatekwahobholela Akilisito henela nga chitutendakupangana patutendakwachalila Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakulya cha Hangwana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Amatayo 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Amaluko 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Aluka 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Bahi mu malagilo gagahika, ngakombola kwalumbalilanga, ligongo pankongananga kwaachalila Annoongo ngapangananga genigala gagabhile gammbone nambo mpangananga gagabhile gabohu. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Kwa kubhee, pankongananga handa chibhoga chichahobhalela Akilisito, ndendakujoa kubhee ntendakumetunika mu malubhalo ga kutaukana pakati jinunji, na nenga ndendakuhobhalela kachoko kubhee nga ukweli. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ukweli nga kubhee, nga hipaalikwa kuganikia kongi kongi pakati jinunji, ili kulangia nga ganiki jwatekondekwa na Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Kweli ntendakongananga, nambo ngabha ligongo lya kulyee chakulya cha Hangwana. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Kwa kubhee panlyenganga, kila jumo jwinunji atendakulyee pangali kunnenda jongi, jonjoni kutama na njala na jongi kolelwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Bholi, ngakombolanga kulyee na kung'wee kwaachinunji? Au bholi, ntendakuchibheluanga chibhoga cha bhandu chichaahobhalela Akilisito na kwatendelanga mbenje bhenaangota bhanga chilebhe? Ninnobholelange chiniki? Bholi, ninnumbalilange kwa ngani ja chikubho heche? Hopo! Ngakombola kunnumbalilanga kwa chikubho heche.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ligongo nenga mbookile malagilo kubhoka kwa Hangwana genigala gandekunnekelanga mwangota, kubhee kilo chela Hangwana Ayesu pabhakabhokekwa, akatola nkate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />akaachukulu Annoongo akagumetula nkate, akalobhola, “Gongoni nga mmele gwangu gugubhile ligongo linunji, ntendange henela kwa kungombokela nenga.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Hela hela, pabhakajomola kulyee, akatola chikombe cha divai, akalobhola, “Heche nga chikombe cha lilagano liyono lililangia kwa miyai jangu. Ntendange henela kila pangw'enganga kwa kungombokela nenga.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kwa kubhee kila panlyenganga nkate gongoni na kung'wela mu chikombe heche, ntandangakwaalobholelanga bhandu kubhee Akilisito akajomoka ligongo linu, mpaka penipala pabhapakuhika kabhele. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Henela, mundu joajola jwaalyee nkate gongoni na kung'wee mu chikombe heche panga palikwa, apakubhee apangine mabohu kwa ngani ja mmele na miyai ja Hangwana. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Bahi, kila mundu apalikwa kuchilolekea oti mwene, tangu ja kulyee nkate na kung'wee mu chikombe chenecho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Ligongo jwaalyee na kung'wee pangali kuimanya kwa ngani ja mmele gwa Hangwana, kwa utenda henela Annoongo apakunhkumula. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Nga ligongo bhajingi pakati jinunji nga akaatamwa na mwangali machili, na bhangi pakati jinunji watekujomokanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Handa tukajeemike kuchilolekea akaachinabhene maha Annoongo akatuhumumwilehopo. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Nambo patuhukumulwa na Annoongo, Annoongo apala tukotokuhumulwa pamo na bhandu cha chilambo. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Henela, akaanung'una bhangu, pankongananga kulyee Chakulya cha Hangwana, kila jumo annende nnyakwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Handa abhi mundu joajola jwaabhile na njala, alyee ku nyumba jakwe, ili pankongananga pamo nkotokuhumulwanga. Na nenga pambakuhika mbakunnyangulanga maha.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Ngwahupa ya Mboomo ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Akaanung'una bhangu, kwa ngani ja ngwahupa ya mboomo ya Annoongo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">Mbala muimanyange maha hikubho heye. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Mmanyanga kubhee pamwakibha tangu mwangaamanya Annoongo, nkatawaliwanga na kutembwanga na hidimu yangalongelanga. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Bahi, muimanyange kubhee mundu joajola jwaatandaikwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo ngakombola kulongela, “Ayesu alaaniwe!” Hela hela jwakwa mundu jwaakombola kulongela, “Ayesu nga Hangwana,” handa jwangatandaikwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Bahi hibhile ngwahupa yengi yengi ya Mboomo jwa Annoongo, nambo Mboomo nga jola jola jumo jwaabhoa ngwahupa yeneyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Hela hela kubhii na namuna hijingi ya kwaatumikila Annoongo, nambo Hangwana jwaatumikilwa nga jumo. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Kubhii na namuna yengi yengi ya kupangana mahengo ga Annoongo, nambo Annoongo nga jwaatujangatila kupangana gena mahengo. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Ngwahupa ja Mboomo jwa Annoongo bhatupekie twenga ili kwaajangatilanga bhandu bhoa. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Mboomo kumpekea jumo lilobhe lya malango, jongi lilobhe lya umanyo kwa Mboomo jojojo. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Mboomo jojojo kumpekea jumo uwecho nkolongwa gwa kuhobhalela, na atendakumpekea jongi ngwahupa cha kulamia. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Jongi atendakumpekea ngwahupa cha kutenda yakangachika, jongi ngwahupa ja kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo, jongi ngwahupa ja kulekania ngwahupa hiibhoka kwa Annoongo au ngabha, jongi atenda kumpekea ngwahupa ja kulongela chilongelo chigeni, na jongi ngwahupa ja kuhatambula yene higeni. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Genago goa nga mahengo ga Mboomo jojojo jumo, na jono Mboomo kummetulila kila mundu, handa chibhapala mwene.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmele nga gumo nambo yeega nga hijingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Handa henela mmele chigubhile gumo na gubhii na yeega hijingi, na yeega yeneyo yoa kugutendea mmele gumo, nga chiibhile kwa Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ligongo mu Mboomo jonojwe jumo bhoa tukabatichwa mu mmele gumo, handa nga Bhayahudi au bhandu bhanga Bhayaudi, handa nga akaabhanda au bhandu bhabhatekulekelelwa, na twenga twabhoa tukapekewa tung'wee Mboomo jono jumo.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Bahi mmele ngabha chiega chimo, bali nga yeega hijingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Handa lukongono lukalongile, “Kwa kubhee nenga ngabha lubhoko, bahi nenga ngabha mmele,” bholi, kulongela henela nga kupakutenda lono lukongono gukotokubhee chiega cha mmele? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Handa lichikilo likalongile, “Kwa kubhee nenga ngabha lio, bahi nenga ngabha lya mmele,” bholi, kwa kulongela henela lene lichikilo likabhilehopo chiega cha mmele? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Handa mmele gwoa kugabhii lio, kujoa kukabhile koji? Na handa mmele gwoa kugabhii lichikilo, mundu akakombwilebholi kunua? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Nambo handa chiibhile, Annoongo akahalakia kila chiega pakwe mu mmele handa chibhakapala mweene. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Handa yoa hikabhii chiega chimo, mmele gukabhile koji? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ukweli nga kubhee, hibhile yeega hijingi nambo mmele nga gumo.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Bahi, lio ngakombola kugulobholela lubhoko, “Ngampala mwenga” wala mutwe ngakombola kugalobholela makongono, “Ngampalanga mwangota.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Nambo badala jakwe, yeniyela yeega ya mmele hibhonekana yangali machili, nga hiipalikwa muno, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />na yeniyela yeega ya mmele hiituibhona yangatopela, nga hiituitopea muno, yeniyela yeega ya mmele yangahalala muno, nga tutendakuitopea muno, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />penipala yeniyela yeega hiitekubhajila ngapalikwa. Nambo Annoongo aibhekite pamo yeega ya mmele na akaitopea muno yeniyela hiitekupongokewa. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Annoongo akatenda henela ili kukotokubhee na mpwilingano mu mmele, bali yeega yoa hitende mahengo kwa kuchikichana. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Handa chiega chimo chitendakulala yoa hitendakuhulala pamo na chenecho. Handa chiega chimo chitendakulumbalilwa, bahi yeega yoa hitendakuhachuka pamo na chenecho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Bahi, mwangota mwabhoa nga mmele gwa Akilisito, kila jumo jwinunji nga chiega cha gono mmele. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Mu chibhoga cha bhandu chichahobhalela Akilisito, Annoongo abhekite kila chilebhe pakwe, bhakajemekanga akaandundame kabhele akabheka akaalondohi bhabhe, kabhele akabheka bhabhajigana, ngapena akabheka bhenibhala bhabhakweti ngwahupa ya kutenda yakangachika, kulamia bhandu na kujangatila, akachilongola na bhabhakombolanga kulongela hilongelo higeni. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Bholi, bhoa nga akaandundame? Bholi, bhoa nga akaalondohi? Bholi, bhoa nga bhabhajigana? Bholi, bhoa bhakweti ngwahupa ja kutenda yakangachika? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Bholi, bhoa bhakweti ngwahupa ja kombola kulamia? Bholi, bhoa bhakweti ngwahupa ja kombola kulongela chilongelo chigeni? Bholi, bhoa bhatendakutambula hilongelo? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Bahi, nnokolilange kupatanga ngwahupa ngolongwa. Na nenga mbakunnangianga ndela jammbone ja kupata yene ngwahupa.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kupalana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Hata handa mbakulongela hilongelo ya bhandu na ya akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo, nambo handa nangali upalio nenga mii handa lilobhe lya lidebe jika au kengele. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Kabhele, ngombola kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo, kongo mmi kuimanya hikubho yoa ya Annoongo yangamanyikana, ngombola kuhobhalela muno hata ngakombwile kuamia litombi, nambo handa nangalia upalio nenga ngabha chilebhe. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Handa moite hilebhe yangu yoa na kwapekeanga akaahocho, na handa moite kila chilebhe chimiinacho, handa nangali upalio nganyangatila chilebhe.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Mundu jwabhile na upalio kuhimbilila, kujangatila bhangi, jwabhile na upalio jwangali bwihu, ngachilolalola, na wala ngachipuna. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Jwabhile na upalio atendakwatopea bhangi, ngalolea hikubho ya kwaajangatila mweene, wala ngatumbala chindema, na wala ngakombokela hikubho ibohu, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />mundu jwabhile na upalio ngahachukila ubohu, nambo atendakuhachukila ukweli. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Mundu jwabhile na upalio kuimbalila kwa yoa, mundu jwabhile na upalio kuhobhalela bhangi, mundu jwabhile na upalio kulupalila.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Upalio ngapela, handa hibhile ngwahupa ya kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo, yeneyo ipakupela lichobha limo, handa hibhile ngwahupa ya kulongela hilongelo higeni, hipakupela lichobha limo, handa gubhile umanyo, na gonogwe gupakupela lichobha limo. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Ligongo umanyo gwitu ngachimanya kila chilebhe, na tutendakumanya kachoko tu patutangacha lilobhe lya Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Nambo chenichela cha kukamilika pachipakuhika, yoa yangakamilika ipakubhoka.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Panakibha mwaana chilemba nakalongela handa mwaana, nakaganikia handa mwaana. Nambo nangocheni nenga nga ngolite na hikubho ya chigwaana nekite. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Chituchibhona nangocheni nga handa ngachibhonanga maha mu chindala chichijingile machi, nambo muda guguhika tupakubhona kila chilebhe maha. Nangocheni ndendakumanya kachoko tu, nambo muda guguhika mbakuimanya kila chilebhe handa chichibhile, handa henela Annoongo chibhatenda kumanya nenga.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Bahi nangocheni, gapakuhigalila gangani jika, kuhobhalela, kulupalila na upalio, nambo likolongwa kupunda yoa nga kwaapalanga bhangi.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Ngwahupa yengi ya Mboomo ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Nchimile kubhee na upalio, hela hela nchimilange kupatanga ngwahupa yengi kubhoka kwa Mboomo jwa Annoongo, muno ngwahupa ja kutangacha malobhe ga Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Jwaalongela chilongelo chigeni ngalongela na bhandu ila alongela na Annoongo kwa kwakubhee jwakwa mundu joajola jwanhelewa. Jonojwe alongela kwa machili ga Mboomo jwa Annoongo hikubho ya Annoongo yangamanyikana. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Nambo jwakweti ngwahupa ja kutangacha malobhe ja Annoongo, kulongela na bhandu na kwalekelanga mitima mu kwahobhalela Akilisito, kwaatenda bhahachukange na kwalekelanga ntima. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Jwaalongela chilongelo chigeni achichenga mweene. Nambo jwaakweti ngwahupa ja kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo, achenga chibhoga cha bhangu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Bahi, ngapaalite mwangota mwabhoa nnongelange chilongelo chigeni nambo ngapaalite muno mmangange na uwecho kutangacha malobhe ga Annoongo, kwa kubhee mundu jwakweti ngwahupa ja kutangacha malobhe ga Annoongo atendakujangatila muno bhandu kupunda jonijola jwalongela chilongelo chigeni. Nambo palikwa abhee mundu jwaapakuhatambula malobhe gagalongeleka, ili bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhajangatilwange. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Nangocheni akaanung'una bhangu, handa nhikite kwaachinu na kulongela chilongelo chigeni mpakuhelewanga chiniki? Ngaajangatilanga chilebhe choachela, handa mbakunkongolelanga genigala gabhanangie Annoongo au umanyo au kutangacha malobhe ga Annoongo au majigano gangi penapo mbakunnyangatilanga muno.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Nga chiibhile kwa yombo yangabhee na umomi hiibhoa lilobhe handa pilimbi na ching'wenye ng'wenye, bholi, mundu akombolabholi kumanya nnyembo pagujembwa handa yombo yeneyo hiigombwa handa ngabhoa lilobhe lya nnyembo gugumanyikana paigombwa? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Kabhele handa lipenga ngapotwa kwa lilobhe lyangamanyikana nga ja niki, nga ganiki jwaapakuchibheka maha ligongo lya ngoondo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Hela hela na mwangota, handa nnongilonge malobhe gangamanyikana mu luunda, mundu apakumanyabholi linnongelanga? Kwa kubhee malobhe ginunji gannongelanga gapakubhee ngamanyikana. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Hibhile hilongelo hijingi pachilambo, na jakwa hata jimo jangabhee na maana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Bahi handa ngamanya maana ja lilobhe lyenelyo, mbakubhee ageni kwa jonijola jwalongela, na jonojwe apakubhee ageni kwangu nenga. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Hela hela na mwangota, kwakubhee mpalanga kubhee na ngwahupa ja Mboomo jwa Annoongo, nchimile kutendanga hikubho yeniyela hiijangatila chibhoga cha bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Henela, jwalongela chilongelo chigeni na ajope ili akombole kupata uwecho gwa kuhatambula. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ligongo handa nyopite kwa chilongelo changu, mboomo jangu jitendakujopa, nambo luunda lwangu ngapata chenichela chindenda kulupalila. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Bahi ipakubhebholi? Pambakujopa kwa luunda lwangu na kujopa kwa mboomo jangu, kabhele mbakujemba kwa luunda lwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Handa mwalumbalile Annoongo kwa mboomo jinu jika, apakumbolabholi mundu jongi jwabhile pakati jinunji kwaachalila Annoongo, kujeketela kujopa kwinu kwa kuchukulu kwa kulongela, “Hibhee henela”, handa ngachimanya chinnongela? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Kujopa kwinunji kwaalumbalila Annoongo komboleka kubhee kwammbone muno, nambo kupakwajangalibholi bhangi.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Ndendakwachukulu Annoongo kubhee nenga ndendakulongela chilongelo chigeni kupunda mwangota bhoa. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Nambo mu hikomiti ya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito mbaya nnongele malobhe nhano gakumanyikana ili naajigane bhandu, nambo ngabha kulongela malobhe elupu ga chilongelo chigeni. <verse eid="1CO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Akaanung'una bhangu, nkotokubhee handa bhana mu kuganikia kwinunji. Kwa ngani ja ubohu, mmangange handa bhana ilemba, nambo mu kuganikia kwinunji mmangange handa bhandu bhabhakolite. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Mu majaandiko ga Annoongo hijaandikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Hangwana alongela henela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">Kwa kupetela akaachinabhene kulongela chilongelo chigeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">na kwa kang'wa ya akaageni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">mbakulongela na abha bhandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">hata henela, nganyonikianga.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Bahi, ngwahupa ja kulongela chilongelo chigeni nga chilolelo, ngabha ligongo lya chibhoga cha bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito, bali nga ligongo lya bhandu bhangahobhalelanga Akilisito, nambo ngwahupa ja kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo nga ligongo lya bhenibhala bhabhahobhalilinge Akilisito na ngabha ligongo lya bhandu bhangahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Bahi, bhandu bhoa bhabhahobhalela Akilisito pabhakongananga, na bhoa bhakajemekanga kulongela chilongelo chigeni, handa bhahikitinge bhandu bhangahobhalela Akilisito, bholi, bhapakulobholanga kubhee mwangota nga mpangai? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Nambo, bhoa bhakibha bhatendakutangachanga ngani ja Annoongo, handa ahikite mundu jwangahobhalela Akilisito, goa gabhapakugajoa gapakunnangia ubohu gwabhe mwene, na goa gabhapakugajoa gapakwajingila na kwaatindigana. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Genigala gangamanyikana mu ntima gwabhe gapakubhekwa pandaa, na jonojwe apakutindibhala majugwa na kwaachalila Annoongo abhikulongela, “Kweli Annoongo abhi pamo na mwangota.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwachalila Annoongo kukupalikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Akaanung'una, bahi tulobhole chiniki? Pankongananga pamo kwaachalila Annoongo, jumo ajembe nyeembo, jongi ajigane, jongi jwakuatambula genigala gabhapatite kubhoka kwa Annoongo, jongi atumie ngwahupa ja kulongela kwa chilongelo chigeni na jongi ahatambule gagalongelwa. Goa nga ligongo lya kwaajangatila bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Handa bhabhilinge bhandu bhabhakweti ngwahupa ja kulongela kwa chilongelo chigeni, bhalongelange bhabhele au bhatatu, ngabha muno, kabhele jumo jumo, na abhee mundu jwa kuhatambula gagalongelwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Nambo handa jwaaakwa mundu jwaakombola kuhatambula, bhena bhandu na bhatamange jii mu malubhalo ga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito na bhalongelange na mitima jabhenji bhene na Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Kwa ngani ja bhabhakweti ngwahupa ja kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo, bhalongelange bhabhele au bhatatu, na bhangi bhajohanikiange malobhe gabhenji. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Handa jumo atendakuendelea kulongela na jongi jwa kujohanikia na kuhatambula genigala gabhapatite kubhoka kwa Annoongo, bahi, jonijola jwaalongela na akotoke. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ligongo bhoa nkombolanga kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo, jumo baada ja jongi, ili bhoa nkombolange kuchijigana na kulekelwa ntima. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Ngwahupa ja kutangacha malobhe ga Annoongo nga jipalikwa kujemelelwa na jonojwe jwaakweti na ngwahupa jenejo.<verse eid="1CO 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ligongo Annoongo ngabha Annoongo bha mpwato, ila nga Annoongo bha kuhengwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />Handa chiiyobhalilike mu malubhalo goa ga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito, akaahikege bhatamange jii mu hikomiti ya bhandu bhabhahobhalile Ayesu. Ngapaalikwa kulongela, ila bhakondange handa chigalongela malagilo. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Handa bhapala konyanga kwa ngani ja chikubho choachela, bhakaakonyange akanalome bhabhenji kwaachabhenji. Ligongo nga honi kwa mwikege kulongela mu chibhoga cha bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Bholi, ng'anikianga lilobhe lya Annoongo libhokite kwaachinu mwangota au litekuhika kwaachinunji ligongo lya mwangota jikajinunji? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Handa mundu joajola aganikia kubhee jonojwe atekulagikwa na Annoongo au akweti ngwahupa ja Mboomo, na aimanye kubhee gangani gananyandikilanga mwangota nga malagilo ga Hangwana Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Nambo mundu jwangaimanya genago, bahi, nkotokunyoanikianga mundu jonojwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Henela akaanung'una bhangu, mpalikwa kulokolila kutangacha lilobhe lya Annoongo, nambo nkotokunkanikia mundu kulongela kwa chilongelo chigeni. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Henela goa gateendeke handa chiipalikwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Nangocheni, akaanung'una bhangu, mbala kunkombokeanga jenijela Ngani Jammbone jinakantangachianga, mwangota nkajihobhalelanga na kujema maha nkati jabhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Kwa kupetela jenejo mpakuhokolewanga, handa mpakutangacha malobhe ganakantangachianga, na handa henela bahi kuhobhalela kwinunji kwangabhee hiyoyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Nenga nakannobholelanga mwangota hikubho yammbone muno hinakapokela nenga, kubhee Akilisito akajomoka ligongo lya kulemwa kwitu handa chiikajandikwa mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />kubhee akachikwa, akayoka lichobha lya tatu handa chiitekujandikwa mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />pagakapeta genago akaabhokela Akefa kwa lihina lyengi nga Apetulo, na kabhele akaapitilanga akaandundame bhenibhala komi na bhabhele. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Ngapena akaapitilanga akaanung'una handa mia tano guna kamo, pakati jabhenji bhajingi tangu bhabhilinge, nambo bhajingi pakati jabhenji bhajomokinge. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ngapena akaapitila Ayakobo na kabhele akaapitilanga akaandundame bhoa.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Kujomoka kwa yoa, akambitila hata nenga, nenga nakibha handa mundu jwanakabhelekwa mu muuda gwangapalikwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Kwa kubhee nenga nangamanyikana muno handa chibhamanyikana pakati ja akaandundame bhoa, na wala nangapaalikwa kemwa naandundame, ligongo nakalilagia lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Nambo, kwa umbone gwabhe Annoongo, ndekubhee handa chimile, na umbone gwabhe kwaachangu ngabha hiyoyo. Nenga ndendite mahengo kupunda bhoa, nambo nangabhee nenga, ila nga umbone gwa Annoongo gugutenda mahengo pamo na nenga. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Nambo hata henela, handa ikabhii nga nenga au bhenaangota au akaandundame bhangi bhoa tutendakutangacha Ngani Jammbone jimo na bhoa tutendakuhobhalela malobhe genago.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Bahi handa tutekutangacha kubhee Akilisito akayoka, mbona bhangi pakati jitu nnongelanga bhandu bhabhatekujomoka Annoongo ngaayoanga? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Nambo handa bhandu ngayokekwa, bahi, najombe Akilisito jwangayoka, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />na handa Akilisito jwangayoka, bahi kutangacha kwitu kwanga maana na kuhobhalela kwitu kwanga maana. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kupunda genago tukabhile bhandu bhatulongela hilebhe ya unami nnongi ja Annoongo, kwakubhee tukalobhola kubhee Annoongo akaayoa Akilisito na kubhee jonojwe jwangaayoa, ikabhii kweli kubhee bhabhajomwikinge ngayokekwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Kwa kubhee handa bhabhajomwikinge ngayokekwa, bahi hata Akilisito jwangayoka. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Kabhele handa Akilisito jwangayoka, bahi, kuhobhalela kwinunji nga hiyoyo, na mwangota tangu mtamanga mu mabohu ginunji. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Henela, bhenibhala bhoa bhabhajomwikinge kongo bhabhi bhalondanike na Akilisito bhatekuhobhanga tu. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Handa kulupalila kwitu kwa Akilisito ligongo lya umomi hogogo, twenga nga bhandu bha kokolekelwa muno kuliko bhandu bhangi bhoa pachilambo.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Nambo ukweli nga kubhee Akilisito atekuyoka, jonojwe nga jwaakajemeka kuyokekwa na Annoongo handa mahuno ga kujemeka ga alemi. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Handa henela malilo chigakaletwa pachilambo kupetela kwa mundu jumo jono nga Aadamu, hela hela kuyoka kutekuhika kupetela mundu jumo na jono nga Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Handa henela bhandu chibhatendakujomoka kwa kulondanika na Aadamu, hela hela bhoa bhapakuyokanga kwa kulondanika na Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Nambo kila jumo kwa muda gwabhe apakujemeka Akilisito, ngapena bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito penipala pabhapakuhika. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Pagapakupeta genago, kupela kupakuhika ngapena Akilisito apakwabhujikia Annoongo Atati umwenye, penepo apakutinia kila ukolo na machili. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kwa kubhee Akilisito apalikwa kutawala mpaka Annoongo pabhapakwabheka pahi ja ukolo gwabhe akaapwati bhabhe bhoa na kwabhekanga pahi ja ukolo gwabhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Apwati jwa kupela jwaapakujomolekelwa nga malilo. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Kwa kubhee Majaandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Annoongo abhekite hilebhe yoa pahi ja ukolo gwabhe.” Nambo Majaandiko pagalobhola, “Hilebhe yoa hibhekitwe pahi ja ukolo gwabhe ili kuitawala.” Nga kubhee Annoongo ngajingila mu chibhoga chenecho cha hilebhe, kwa kubhee jonojwe nga jwaabheka hilebhe yoha pahi ja ukolo gwa Akilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Nambo hilebhe yoa paipakubhekwa pahi ja ukolo gwa Akilisito, ngapena na jonojwe Mwana pabhapakujibheka pahi ja ukolo gwabhe, kupala Annoongo abhee akolo jwa hilebhe yoa.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Handa bhandu bhabhajomwikinge ngayokekwa, bholi bhandu bhenibhla bhabhabatichwa ligongo lya bhabhajomwikinge bhakulupalila kupata chiniki? Handa ngayokekwa, ja niki kubatichwa ligongo lya bhenaangota? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Ja niki twenga tuchilekela mu ngondo machobha goa? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Handa kuchipuna kwangu nga ligongo linunji mu Akilisito Ayesu Hangwana bhitu nga kweli, akaanung'una bhangu, ndendakujomoka kila lichobha. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Handa kwa kulupalila bhandu tu ngapotana na bhandu bha konokwe ku Efeso bhabhakibha handa hinyama yakalipa ya kumanyahi. Ngapatite chilebhe niki kwa chikubho hecho? Handa bhandu bhabhajomwikinge ngayokekwa, bahi, “Tulyee na tung'wee, ligongo malabhi tupakujomoka.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nkotokutembwa! Kuchikichana na bhandu akaabohu kutenda kujambukia hikubho hibohu. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Nyimukange! Nyemekange kupangana hikubho yammbone, na nnekange kutenda mabohu. Ligongo bhangi pakati jinunji ngaamanya Annoongo hata kachoko. Ndendakulongela gangani ili nkolange honi.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyokekwa kwa mmele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Nambo mundu akombola konya, “Bhandu bhapakoyokekwabholi? Mimele jabhenji jibhakubhee bholi?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Nkotokuganikia handa mundu jwangamanya choachela! Pampanda mbeju jitenda kuwee oti ngapena jibhee jimomi popopo jijemeka kumela na kubhee mmela guyono. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Chimchipandanga nga mbeju jika, komboleka nga ja ngaano au jengi, na ngabha mmela gwoa gugumela machobha gagahika. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Nambo Annoongo kujipekea jene mbeju mmele gabhagupala mwene, kila mbeju kupata mmele gwabhe gwa jika.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Mimele ja hiyumbe yoa ngalandana. Mimele ja bhandu jitendakulandana, ya hinyama ngalandana, ya hijuni nga ja namuna jengi na mimele ja homba nga ja namuna jengi. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Henele, jibhile mimele ja kunani kwa Annoongo na mimele ja pachilambo, kuhalala kwa mimele ja kunani kwa Annoongo nga kongi, na kuhalala kwa mimele ja pachilambo nga kongi. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Kubhile kuhalala kwa lyobha, gwa mwei na gwa ndondwa, hata ndondwa nayombe hitekulekana kwa kuhalala.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Henela nga chiibhile kwa kuyokekwa kwa bhandu bhabhawilinge. Handa henela mbeju, mmele kuchikwa pamandopi ngapena gupakuhalibika, nambo gono mmele gupakuyokekwa na kubhee mmele gwangahalibika. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Mmele pagukuchikwa ngaalala, ngabhee na machili, na paguyokekwa gubhee gwa kuhalala na machili. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Paguchikwa gubhee mmele jika, paguyokekwa gubhee mmele gwa chimboomo. Gubhile mmele gwa kubhelekwa nago na mmele gwa chimboomo. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Kwa kubhee Majaandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Mundu jwaajemike nga Aadamu, jonojwe akapekewa umomi”, nambo Aadamu jwa kupela nga Mboomo jwaapekeanga bhandu umomi. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Nambo ngabha gwagola gwa chimboomo gugulongolela, ila nga gwagola mmele gwa kubhelekwa nago, ngapena gwagola mmele gwa chimboomo. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Mundu jwaakajemeka kuhalakilwa kwa undopi nga Aadamu, na mundu jwa bhele akabhoka kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Bhandu bhoa bhabhabhilinge bha pachilambo bhabhilinge handa mundu jonojwe jwaatekuhalakilwa kwa undopi, bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge bha kunani kwa Annoongo bhabhilinge handa jonijola jwaabhokite kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Kwa muda gongoni tupekiwe mmele gwa jonijola jwatekuhalakilwa kwa undopi, hela hela lichobha limo tupakulandana na mmele gwa jonijola jwabhokite kunani kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Bahi akaanung'una bhangu, ndendakulongela henela, chenichela chichitenditwe kwa mmele na miyai ngakombola kuchikichana umwenye gwa Annoongo, na mmele gwa kuhalibika ngakombola kubhee mmele gwangahalibhika.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Nyoanikiange, ndendakunnobholelanga genigala Annoongo jwangaakongolelanga bhandu, twenga ngajomoka twabhoa, ila bhoa tupakupendekulikwa, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />ng'ang'anu handa kopela na kuhunukula miho lipenga lya kupela palipakuhona, bhandu bhabhawilinge bhapakuyokekwa bhabhi na mimele jakomboleka kujomoka kabhele, na twenga tupakupendekulikwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Ligongo kila chichihalibika chiwale chilebhee changahalibika, mmele gugukombola kujomoka guwale mmele gwangahalibika. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Bahi, mmele gongoni guguhalibhika pagupachiwalila mmele gwaangakujomoka, na chenichela chichijomoka pachipakuchiwalila kulepela kujomoka, penapo nga palipakwela lyenilyela lilobhe lilijandikwe, “Malilo gatekutinikikwa, na uchindi gukweelite kwa kamilika!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Malilo, uwecho gwinu gubhi koji?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Uwecho gwinu gwa kuhulaa gubhi koji?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Malilo gapata machili ga kuhulaa kubhoka mu mabohu, na gena mabohu gapata machili ga kutuhulaa kubhoka mu malagilo. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Nambo tutendakwaachukulu Annoongo jwaatupekea uwecho kwa ndela ja Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Bahi, akaanung'una bhangu bhanampalanga, nnyemange maha. Mpundange kupangana mahengo ga Hangwana, mmikumanya kubhee lihengo lintendanga kwa Hangwana ngahobha hiyoyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Kwaachangilanga bhandu bhabahobhalela Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Nangocheni, kwa ngani jenijela ja kwaachangilanga bhandu bhabhaahobhalela Akilisito, ntendange handa chingalagia kwa chibhoga cha bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha ku Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Kila lichobha lya juma pili, jumo jwinunji abheke nnyeenje mbiya kachoko kubhokana na chenichela chibhapata, ili kukotokubhee na kuchangilana kabhele mu machobha genigala pambakuhika. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Penipala pambakuhika kwaachinunji, mbakwatumanga bhenibhala bhambakwaahagula pakati jinunji bhapelekange balua na yeniyela hibhatekuchangilanga ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Handa ipakubhee yammbone na nenga nyaule, bahi, bhapakulongana pamo na nenga.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpango gwa Apaulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Mbakuhika kwaachinunji pambakujomola kupetela ku Makedonia, ligongo mbala kwatyangilanga bhandu bha konokwe ku Makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Komboleka mbakutama kwaachinunji kwa machobha teno, au komboleka mbakutama pamo na mwangota machobha goa ga malili, ili nkombolange kunyangatila kuendelea mu ulendo gwangu koakola kunyaula. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Mbalitehopo kupeta kwaachinunji chindemachindema na kuendelea na ulendo. Mbala kutama kwinunji kwa machobha gajingi, handa apalite Hangwana.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Nambo mbakutama pambani pa Efeso mpaka lichobha lya Pentekosite. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Annoongo ambekie upenyo nkolongwa gwa kupangana lihengo likolongwa pambani, na konokwe bhabhilinge bhandu bhajingi ngakoonda mbangane lihengo helyo.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Atimotheo handa ahikite kwaachinunji mumpokelange maha, nnolange akotokubhee na bhoga goagola pabhapakubhee pamo na mwangota, ligongo atendakupangana lihengo lya Hangwana handa nenga. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Henela mundu joajola akotokummeluanga, ila munyangatilanange aendelee na ulendo gwabhe kwa kuhengwa ili akombole kubhuja kwaachangu, ligongo nenga pamo na akaanung'una bhangu tutendakwaalendela.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Bahi kwa ngani ya akaanung'una bhitu Aapolo, ndekwapembelea muno ahike kwaachinunji pamo na akaanung'una bhangi, nambo ngaachukila hata kachoko kuhika nangocheni ila apakuhika penipala pabhapakupata upenyo.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe ga kujomolekea na chalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Ncheange, nyemange maha mu kuhobhalela, na wala nkotokujogopanga. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Kila chintendanga ntendange kwa kupalana.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Aakaanung'una bhangu, ntendakwamanyanga bhandu bha kaaja kwa Asitefana, bhenaangota nga bhandu bhabhakajemeka kwahobhalela Akilisito konokwe ku Akaya, na bhetekuchitolea kwatumikilanga bhandu bha Annoongo. Ndendakumpembeleanga muno mwangota akaanung'una bhangu, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />ipalikwa mwatopeange bhandu handa bhenabho, ntendange genigala gabhankongolelanga, hela hela mwatopeange bhandu bhabhaatumikila Annoongo pamo na bhenaangota.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Ndendakuhachuka muno kubhee Astefana na Afotunato na Aakaiko bhatekuhikanga, ligongo bhenaangota bhatekumbekeanga genigala gagatekupongoka. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Kwa kubhee bhatekuguhachua ntima gwangu hela hela handa chibhatekuntendanga mwangota kuhachuka. Henela nga yammbone kwaamanyanga bhandu handa bhenaangota.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Mabhoga ga bhandu gabhahobhalela Akilisito bha ku Asia bhatendakunchalimianga. Aakila na Apilisika pamo na libhoga lya bhandu lilyahobhalela Akilisito bhabhabhilinge mu nyuumba yabhenji bhatendakunchalimianga muno mu kulondekana na Hangwana. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Bhandu bhoa bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha pambani bhatendakunchalimianga. Na mwangota nchalimianange mmi kulangia kubhee ntandakupalana.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nenga Apaulo ndendakunchalimianga, mii kujandika kwa lubhoko lwangu mweene. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Joajola jwangaapala Hangwana, na alaaniwe. Malanata maana jakwe Hangwana bhitu, nhike!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Ndendakwaajopa Hangwana Ayesu antendelange hikubho yammbone. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ndendakumpalanga mwangota mwabhoa muntekulondanika na Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>